@startuml Corrected Unified Flow - Event-Driven Architecture
!theme plain
title <font size=24 color="#2E7D32"><b>CORRECTED: Unified Event-Driven Architecture</b></font>\n<font size=14 color="#388E3C">Single source of truth: Contract State Machine</font>

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor<<draft>> #2196F3
    FontColor<<draft>> #FFFFFF
    BackgroundColor<<pending>> #FF9800
    FontColor<<pending>> #000000
    BackgroundColor<<ready>> #4CAF50
    FontColor<<ready>> #FFFFFF
    BackgroundColor<<committed>> #8BC34A
    FontColor<<committed>> #000000
    BackgroundColor<<fulfilled>> #009688
    FontColor<<fulfilled>> #FFFFFF
    BackgroundColor<<event>> #E3F2FD
    FontColor<<event>> #000000
}

state "Contract State Machine" as StateMachine {
    state "DRAFT" as Draft <<draft>>
    state "PENDING" as Pending <<pending>>
    state "READY_TO_COMMIT" as Ready <<ready>>
    state "COMMITTED" as Committed <<committed>>
    state "FULFILLED" as Fulfilled <<fulfilled>>

    [*] --> Draft : ContractService.createContract()
    Draft --> Pending : PaymentAuthorizedEventHandler
    Pending --> Ready : All conditions fulfilled
    Ready --> Committed : StripeOrderCreationHandler\n(Order created)
    Committed --> Fulfilled : WebhookProcessingService\n(Payment confirmed)
    Fulfilled --> [*]
}

note right of Draft
  Frontend Trigger:
  createCheckoutSession()
end note

note right of Pending
  Event-Driven:
  PaymentAuthorizedEvent
end note

note right of Committed
  Order Exists:
  oxorder created
end note

note right of Fulfilled
  Webhook Trigger:
  payment_intent.succeeded
end note

state "Event System" as Events {
    state "ContractCreatedEvent" as E1 <<event>>
    state "ContractPendingEvent" as E2 <<event>>
    state "ContractReadyEvent" as E3 <<event>>
    state "ContractCommittedEvent" as E4 <<event>>
    state "ContractFulfilledEvent" as E5 <<event>>
}

E1 --> E2 : dispatches
E2 --> E3 : dispatches
E3 --> E4 : dispatches
E4 --> E5 : dispatches

note bottom of Events
  All state transitions emit events!
  Subscribers: Email, AuditLog, Analytics
end note

legend bottom
  |= Component |= Responsibility |
  | Contract State Machine | Single source of truth for payment lifecycle |
  | Event System | Enables decoupled event-driven architecture |
  | WebhookProcessingService | Contract-aware - finds contract first |
  | osc_payment_contract | Central entity knows order and provider |
endlegend

@enduml
